      "value": "I’ve the same issue everything is messed up with the new ik system the view points are bad Avis now run while in fbt ( now you can’t look like a car) and even with setting my irl height my view point is no where near the face to the point half of the time I can’t do anything with my controller to pick up anything it stops working. I’ve just given up to be able to use my fbt or dance because of this update ( I don’t use mods or anything )",
